<section id="field-team" aria-labelledby="field-team-title" class="bg-surface py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="@container w-full max-w-3xl"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">07</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Field tested</p><h2 id="field-team-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Worn</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">by</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">people</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">who</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">measure</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">everything.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">Over 14 months, our field team of endurance athletes wore pre-production bands through races, training blocks and recovery weeks.</div></div><ul data-stagger="true" class="mt-14 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col rounded-[28px] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8"><figure class="flex h-full flex-col"><blockquote class="text-xl leading-snug text-ink text-pretty"><p>“<!-- -->I stopped looking at my wrist mid-race. The band tells me what I need when I need it, through a haptic nudge, and nothing else.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><figcaption class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-sm font-semibold text-white">LH</span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink">Lena Hartmann</span><span class="block text-[13px] text-ink/55">Ultra-trail runner<!-- --> · <!-- -->Field team since beta · 2,140 km logged</span></span></figcaption></figure></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-[28px] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8"><figure class="flex h-full flex-col"><blockquote class="text-xl leading-snug text-ink text-pretty"><p>“<!-- -->My HRV trend flagged overreaching two days before I felt it. I backed off, and set a 2k best the following week.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><figcaption class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-sm font-semibold text-white">MB</span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink">Marcus Bell</span><span class="block text-[13px] text-ink/55">Competitive rower<!-- --> · <!-- -->Field team since beta · 318 sessions</span></span></figcaption></figure></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-[28px] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8"><figure class="flex h-full flex-col"><blockquote class="text-xl leading-snug text-ink text-pretty"><p>“<!-- -->It disappears at night. The sleep and recovery data has become the most honest coach I have.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><figcaption class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-sm font-semibold text-white">AT</span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink">Aiko Tanaka</span><span class="block text-[13px] text-ink/55">Long-course triathlete<!-- --> · <!-- -->Field team since beta · 196 nights tracked</span></span></figcaption></figure></li></ul></div></section>
